a9:["$","tr","8b9610f5-bf20-4704-8fe1-b82175a8a8da",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"children":["$","$L17",null,{"as":"span","size":"regular","color":"secondary","children":"Measures for allowing data portability and ensuring erasure "}]}],["$","td","1",{"children":["$","$L17",null,{"as":"span","size":"regular","color":"tertiary","children":"Customer can ask for a copy of its Personal Data in a machine-readable format. Customer can also request that Linear transmit the data to another controller where technically feasible. The Service allows ability to export relevant application data in a standard CSV format. Additional export capabilities for all the customer data is available through an API. In the case that a customer wishes to exercise portability or erasure rights, the Linear has measures of retrieving securely stored data and has a process in place to ensure access is restricted only to those who have a business justification for accessing data during the copy, transfer, or erasure. "}]}]]}]
